edb/ref 1071 "Find a vector that's tangent to the curve $r(t)=⟨t+\\frac{1}{t},\\,t-\\frac{1}{t}⟩$ at the point where $t=1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345043 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "607c69e9-9d6e-5de2-af4e-cf5bd02dd46c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345043 #edb/ref 1074 "At the point where $t=1$,  the vector ${r}^{′}(1)$ is tangent to the curve.\n\nLet's calculate ${r}^{′}(t)$ and evaluate it at $t=1:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+\\frac{1}{t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t-\\frac{1}{t})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩ \\\\ {r}^{′}(1) & =⟨1-\\frac{1}{{1}^{2}},\\,1+\\frac{1}{{1}^{2}}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-1,\\,1+1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a tangent vector to the given curve at the point where $t=1$  is  $⟨0,\\,2⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345045 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186344904 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345045 #edb/ref 1069 "q-75199" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345045 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345045 #edb/ref 1071 "Find a tangent vector to the curve $r(t)=⟨{e}^{t},\\,{e}^{-t},\\,{t}^{2}⟩$ at the point where $t=0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345045 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d979bdae-e51f-5a47-9ba4-fdf00565f442" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186345045 #edb/ref 1074 "At the point where $t=0$,  the vector ${r}^{′}(0)$ is tangent to the curve.\n\nLet's calculate ${r}^{′}(t)$ and evaluate it at $t=0$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}{e}^{t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}{e}^{-t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,-{e}^{-t},\\,2t⟩ \\\\ {r}^{′}(0) & =⟨{e}^{0},\\,-{e}^{-0},\\,2\\cdot 0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-1,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a tangent vector to the given curve at the point where $t=0$ is $⟨1,\\,-1,\\,0⟩.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400247 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186400248 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218640024